{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8674ff06-c84f-8af7-ad2c-a76127c9f13d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:45:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Patrick McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:43:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation department, this is Beth, good morning! How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:43:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I'm calling about buying a memorial bench, for one of the beach parks. I've got some information here I'm reading from, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:43:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no problem. Take your time. Do you have a particular park or beach in mind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:43:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, um, let me find my place. [pause] Okay. It says here, bench program, public parks and waterfront areas. We were hoping for somewhere near the water, a beach park, if that's possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:43:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's possible, depending on what's available. Locations are usually limited, so the department looks at what spots are open and whether a bench fits. Is this for a family or for your business?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:44:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It would be through my business. We want to do it in the name of a longtime customer. Sorry, one second. [pause] No, bud, not yet. Just a few more minutes. Sorry, my son is asking if it's time to go yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:44:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right! Tell him we're almost done. So what I'd do is take your name and number and get you the application and the list of possible locations."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:44:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's Patrick McCarthy, M-c-C-a-r-t-h-y. The number is 401-555-0176."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:44:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Patrick, 401-555-0176. I'll have the bench information sent over to you. Someone from the parks side will review the location request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:44:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Will I need to call back after that, or will somebody contact me? I just want to know if a follow-up call is needed on my end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:44:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You shouldn't need to call us. Once the request is reviewed, someone will reach out to you. If a week or two goes by and you haven't heard anything, feel free to call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:44:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works. So I wait for the information and then fill it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:45:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:45:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:45:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome! Have a good day, and enjoy the rest of your lunch hour with your little guy."
    }
  ],
